30	 * (lastName, postcode), a second owner in an existing household is either rejected with 409 or,
31	 * with {@code sharesHousehold}, created as a declared member — and a declared member is not a
32	 * suspected duplicate. No other owner can share a household, so no created owner is ever flagged.
